flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/paths-overlaps-11.zon: flong.box drives containers.box, and would bind / into a session. That reaches flong's state, the user manager's bus or private socket, /proc, the cgroup filesystem or a path in flong.box.protect, any of which lets a session act as the caller outside it. The check here is lexical; the launcher's canonical one refuses the rest at launch.
flong check: @GOLDEN@/decl/paths-overlaps-11.zon: flong.box drives containers.box, and / is not a clean absolute path: it is /, or has a trailing slash, an empty, . or .. component, or a component over 255 bytes. The launcher would refuse it at launch.
